    <sys:String x:Key="LOC_Yalgrin_SimpleSync_Settings_Warning" xml:space="preserve">WARNING! READ ME FIRST!

When first connecting to the sync server, it is recommended to keep the checkboxes above unchecked and manually do a full fetch and sync using the options in the main menu -> Extensions -> Simple Sync. You can enable the options above afterwards.

When connecting additional Playnite instances to the server, it is recommended to start with an empty instance or with all files copied from the source machine. You can use an instance with an already populated library, however be warned that you might lose some extension data.

Extension data is NOT synced across devices.

You might also be asked to manually update default completion statuses in additional instances. Check notifications for when that's needed.</sys:String>

